OL,3,GNEWSAHeroes championed at BBC Make a
OL,4,ADifference Awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eight-year-old recycling star who
OL,7,Fprevented more than 11,000 sweet tubs
OL,8,Fgoing into landfill and an 86-year-old
OL,9,Fgymnastics coach were amongst those
OL,10,Fhonoured at an award ceremony held to
OL,11,Fcelebrate local heroes.
OL,13,FThe BBC Radio Solent Make a Difference
OL,14,FAwards had eight categories,
OL,15,Frecognising those who love to make life
OL,16,Fbetter for others in the area.
OL,18,FTo date, millions of people have been
OL,19,Finvolved in Make a Difference across
OL,20,FBBC radio stations.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
