OL,3,GNEWSAHeroes championed at BBC Make a
OL,4,ADifference Awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung hero Teddy, from Netley,
OL,7,FHampshire, was given his award
OL,8,Falongside other winners at the Utilita
OL,9,FBowl in Southampton on Tuesday.
